    "| R4 | EMI > 45% of monthly income |\n",
    "| R5 | Age < 23 |\n",
    "| R6 | Any overdue amount on bureau record |\n",
    "| R7 | More than 4 credit enquiries in the last quarter |\n",
    "| R8 | Occupation field is blank |\n"
